{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-4", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "走上街道", "storyInfo": "互助会的岛民劫持了通讯信号，袭击为打捞起重机供能的灯塔。船厂的一名船工失踪，德·托莱多决意找人。德鲁莎只身前往互助会所在地。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_sunlight_r", "layer": 1.0, "y": 200.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$beach", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "27_g24_cloudy_sea", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "BackgroundTween", "attributes": {"xTo": 65.0, "duration": 30.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$tech_intro", "key": "$tech_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我曾经觉得大海每天都是一个样。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "浑浊，吝啬，没有尽头，连一条鳞都不肯施舍。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在看来是我以前站得不够高，明明每一个浪头，每一块礁石，每一阵海风的气味都不一样。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "通讯声B"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请汇报今天的海面情况和灯塔运行数据，守塔人。", "name": "通讯声B"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别那么一本正经的，艾尔玛。我知道你羡慕我的工作，从这里看到的风景简直不像我前半生认识的伊比利亚。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜，还要等几天港都中心城区才能被打捞起来，现在除了清扫海域的船只，海面上看不到任何东西。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且刚修复完的供能灯塔闻上去有股新家的味道，不知道其余三十六座是不是也这样——", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉蒙！汇报情况！", "name": "通讯声B"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "知道了，知道了……", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三个月以来什么意外都没发生过，而且每座灯塔都有惩戒军小队驻守，你根本不用那么焦虑，凌晨出门的时候你都把我吵醒了……", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "上午8点49分，海洋监测汇报，沿岸风力五级，阵风六级，未监测到风暴潮。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天是个好日子，长官。", "name": "通讯声A"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_ibindoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$plot_intro", "key": "$plot_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……滋……海洋监测汇报……滋……", "name": "无线电"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……沿岸风力……未监测到风暴潮……", "name": "无线电"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openfoodcan"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（打开罐头）", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_sheepchewpaper", "loop": "true", "channel": "jj"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "jj", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（咀嚼）", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个鳞罐头，一把贝壳叉子，一顿普通的伊比利亚早餐。"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他像一名普通的伊比利亚人一样喝完罐头里的汁水，来自大海的盐分会为他提供必要的能量。"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……七号灯塔……供能系统运转稳定……", "name": "无线电"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……三十一号……动态载荷监测系统已开启……", "name": "无线电"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……十四……通讯信号一切正常……", "name": "无线电"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fauceton"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（清洗餐具）", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（清洗罐头）", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_open_drawer"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他将叉子收进抽屉，又将接满净水的罐头放在房间的角落。"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一只云兽跳进破损的窗户，绕过地上的石头和碎玻璃，走向水源。"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……号灯塔……驻守供能灯塔的人数不变……", "name": "无线电"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……一个小时后换班……明白……", "name": "无线电"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$p_imp_funnel_end_h"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海藻晾晒的时日不够，他还不能收回来；窗户三天前就该修补，所幸最近没有下雨。"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他环视一周，只拿起捕鳞钩，离开了家。"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fishhook_pickup"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorclosequite"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$beach", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海风吹起窗帘，斑驳的墙壁替曾经的住民言语。"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 3.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_blackmask", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（被划去的伊比利亚经文）<i>“用盐摩擦伤口，疼痛是德行的印证，使异种的血肉无处滋长。”</i>", "name": "墙上的刻字"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（错乱的阿戈尔语）<i>他们不会宽恕，我们不会原谅。</i>", "name": "墙上的刻字"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "27_g20_lighthouse_core", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海面起浪了，明明一个小时前汇报的时候还好好的。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "害怕了？", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是嫌麻烦。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海况会影响供能系统运行，驻守的惩戒军正在换班，我们还得自己联络岗哨的通讯员，让他们通知打捞中心的人，调整水下作业的安排。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，等港都中心城区重新升起，我们就能安安心心地数着海面上的帆船，不用再做这样麻烦的联络工作了。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "得了吧，我看你倒是很享受，还能借着工作时间和艾尔玛聊天。", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，不对。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你还想狡辩？刚刚你们的通讯我可是都在这里听到了——", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我是说通讯声不对。我们的射频滤波器出问题了？怎么信号断断续续的？", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，正常。最近两个月里时不时就这么来一次，一会儿就好。", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看来阿戈尔技术的产物也不是那么好用啊……", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "水土不服嘛，打捞中心的新监事已经开始优化所有技术配件了，灯塔供能系统的硬件过几天也能更新。", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且再不济我们这儿也有人维修啊，是从打捞中心来的，那个岛民叫什么来着？", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不记得。", "name": "守塔人A"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，正好，他来了。", "name": "守塔人B"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不对劲……拉蒙，快呼叫岗哨！", "name": "守塔人B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fishhook_pickup"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（举起捕鳞钩）", "name": "岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_hammer"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g9_gdsentry", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2277_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "信号中断多久了？", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "七分钟。", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "三十七座灯塔的通讯信号被一并劫持，通讯员还在排查设备故障的原因，还不确定是哪座灯塔遇袭导致的。", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "距离最后的打捞工作结束还有一周，这个时候袭击为起重机供能的灯塔矩阵，袭击者是想破坏打捞计划，让伊比利亚和阿戈尔生隙……", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "驻守灯塔的惩戒军呢？", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "除了离岗哨最近的三支队伍外，其余小队全部失联。", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这三支小队刚刚回来，他们都说自己收到了审判庭中枢的加密通讯，要求小队马上到岗哨待命，我猜测其他小队也收到了假消息。", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "袭击者不可能自投罗网，这三支小队驻守的灯塔离岗哨太近，大概率不是他们的目标。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们必须立刻确认其余三十四座供能灯塔的情况。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "长官，供能灯塔位置太过分散，而且大多地处偏远。我们现在无法得知袭击者的人数，也不知道他们到底入侵了哪座灯塔……", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "让驻守岗哨的所有人员立刻出动，沿水道行军，前往其余的三十四座灯塔确认情况。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行动组一组前往海岸，提防水中异动，别让恐鱼成为潜在威胁。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "二组负责沿街盘查，寻找可靠目击者，尽可能掌握袭击者的动向。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明白。巡逻组怎么安排？", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在原本的巡逻路线上待命，我们已经收到圣徒阁下的指示，优先排除街道上的潜在威胁，保障平民的安全。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可这样一来支援灯塔的人手就不够了，万一供能系统被毁，那港都中心城区的打捞计划就彻底……", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚必将迎回它原本辉煌的心脏。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒阁下。", "name": "惩戒军士官"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但当下哪怕打捞计划受阻，我们也要避免岛民和伊比利亚民众之间长久以来的积怨再度被挑动。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一座在积怨与晦暗中升起的城市，对伊比利亚又有何益？", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明白！", "name": "惩戒军士兵"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行动吧。命令通讯队继续排查设备故障，争取尽快恢复通讯信号，以及……", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "联络克莱门莎监事，我们需要援助。", "name": "圣徒卡门"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.4, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "发生什么了，船厂外怎么有那么多审判庭的队伍经过？", "name": "制帆匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且为什么斐戴拉大审判官说，船厂的任何相关人员不得出于任何理由离开船厂？难道外面发生了动乱……", "name": "制帆匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了好了，知道那些惩戒军为什么让我们待在这儿吗？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是因为我们——堂堂王室海军舰队预备军的震慑力太强，不适合在这种场合露面。那些惩戒军肯定是完全能搞定，才不劳烦我们出去的。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“……祈祷诸位能驱使审判的灯火……洗涤我们的戴罪之身……”", "name": "制帆匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，萨尔瓦多整天念这几句，搞得大家都学会了……不对，他人呢？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我、我不知道。外面起了动静之后就没见过他了。", "name": "制帆匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#2$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等，德·托莱多大人，别去找他了，斐戴拉大审判官再三强调……", "name": "制帆匠"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我听到了，那个大审判官嗓门大得像地震。但这也代表船厂的惩戒军不会动，哪怕上报有人失踪也根本不会调派人手去找。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他的家人都在原本的村镇，等着他在这里修船领到的薪酬，不能让他不明不白地没了音讯。虽然他还不是我德·托莱多的拥护者，但……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "保不齐之后他就成了我麾下的一员呢？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要去找他。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g5_gdsquare_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armywalking", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好多审判庭的队伍，今天怎么这么大阵仗……", "name": "瑟缩的平民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喂，你。", "name": "巡逻的惩戒军？"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎哟，长、长官，我刚刚已经跟一位审判官报告过了，住在这儿的岛民都很可疑，都该盘查，我——", "name": "瑟缩的平民"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，所以你把我也报上去了？", "name": "巡逻的惩戒军？"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔人……穿着惩戒军的制服……？", "name": "瑟缩的平民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好意思，翘班有点多，没在街道上见过我也正常。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这里是广场附近的街区，你周围住的都是打捞中心的技术工吧？昨天晚上宵禁之后，你听到外面有什么动静吗？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没、没有，他们一般清晨才会出门，而且这几天晚上，他们家里的鳞油灯都点得很亮，没有什么异常。", "name": "瑟缩的平民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你确定你的观察无误？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我胆子小……每天都会确认的……", "name": "瑟缩的平民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_459_1#1$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有异常，很好，那这里就排除了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "剩下的只有——", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "东侧临海的这座废弃工坊了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只为疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人开门的教堂，给我解答吧。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到底是谁躲在背后，为了何种目的，煽动我的同胞？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_gateopen"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}